export function parseNativeUserSourceDraftV3(v:unknown):NativeUserSourceDraftV3{const r=record(v,['schemaVersion','internalId','expectedLocalRevision','name','apiKey','sourcePresetId','advanced','probeSelection']);if(r.schemaVersion!==3)invalid();const internalId=nullable(r.internalId,id),expectedLocalRevision=nullable(r.expectedLocalRevision,hash);if((internalId===null)!==(expectedLocalRevision===null))invalid();const advanced=nullable(r.advanced,v=>{const a=record(v,['baseUrl','anthropicUrl','modelsUrl','protocol']);return {baseUrl:endpoint(a.baseUrl),anthropicUrl:nullable(a.anthropicUrl,endpoint),modelsUrl:nullable(a.modelsUrl,endpoint),protocol:nullable(a.protocol,protocol)}}),probeSelection=nullable(r.probeSelection,selection),apiKey=text(r.apiKey,8192);if(apiKey.startsWith('enc:')||advanced?.protocol!==null&&advanced?.protocol!==undefined&&probeSelection!==null&&advanced.protocol!==probeSelection.protocol)invalid();return {schemaVersion:3,internalId,expectedLocalRevision,name:text(r.name,256),apiKey,sourcePresetId:nullable(r.sourcePresetId,provider),advanced,probeSelection}}
export function parseNativeUserSourceCheckV3(v:unknown):NativeUserSourceCheckV3{const r=record(v,['schemaVersion','route','state','sourceRevision','inventory','ping','probe','probeSelection','admittedModels','verificationId','verifiedAt','expiresAt','errorCode']);if(r.schemaVersion!==3||r.probe!==null||!['discovered','source_checked','unsupported','failed'].includes(r.state as string))invalid();const inventory=nullable(r.inventory,parseDiscoveredModelCatalogV2),probeSelection=nullable(r.probeSelection,selection),admittedModels=models(r.admittedModels),verificationId=nullable(r.verificationId,uuid),verifiedAt=nullable(r.verifiedAt,instant),expiresAt=nullable(r.expiresAt,instant),sourceRevision=nullable(r.sourceRevision,hash),errorCode=nullable(r.errorCode,id);if(r.state==='source_checked'){if(!verificationId||!verifiedAt||!expiresAt||Date.parse(expiresAt)<=Date.parse(verifiedAt)||Date.parse(expiresAt)-Date.parse(verifiedAt)>600000||sourceRevision===null||probeSelection===null||errorCode!==null||!inventory?.models.some(m=>m.exactModelId===probeSelection.exactModelId&&m.lifecycle!=='retired')||!admittedModels.some(m=>m.exactModelId===probeSelection.exactModelId&&m.protocol===probeSelection.protocol))invalid()}else{if([verificationId,verifiedAt,expiresAt,sourceRevision].some(v=>v!==null))invalid();if(r.state==='discovered'?(!inventory||errorCode!==null):errorCode===null)invalid()};return {schemaVersion:3,route:route(r.route),state:r.state as NativeUserSourceCheckV3['state'],sourceRevision,inventory,ping:ping(r.ping),probe:null,probeSelection,admittedModels,verificationId,verifiedAt,expiresAt,errorCode}}
export function parseNativeUserSourceSaveRequestV3(v:unknown):NativeUserSourceSaveRequestV3{const r=record(v,['schemaVersion','operationId','draft','verificationId']);if(r.schemaVersion!==3)invalid();const draft=parseNativeUserSourceDraftV3(r.draft);if(draft.probeSelection===null)invalid();return {schemaVersion:3,operationId:uuid(r.operationId),draft,verificationId:uuid(r.verificationId)}}
export function parseNativeUserSourceSaveResultV3(v:unknown):NativeUserSourceSaveResultV3{const r=record(v,['schemaVersion','operationId','state','route','localRef','localRevision','sourceRevision','inventoryRevision','pendingPhase']);if(r.schemaVersion!==3||(r.state!=='saved'&&r.state!=='pending'))invalid();if(r.state==='saved'?r.pendingPhase!==null:r.pendingPhase!=='local_publish')invalid();return {schemaVersion:3,operationId:uuid(r.operationId),state:r.state as NativeUserSourceSaveResultV3['state'],route:route(r.route),localRef:id(r.localRef),localRevision:hash(r.localRevision),sourceRevision:hash(r.sourceRevision),inventoryRevision:hash(r.inventoryRevision),pendingPhase:r.pendingPhase as 'local_publish'|null}}
export function parseNativeUserSourcesV3(v:unknown):NativeUserSourceViewV3[]{const rows=array(v,128).map(v=>{const r=record(v,['schemaVersion','localRef','localRevision','sourceRevision','name','route','inventory','probeSelection','state','operationId','configuration']);if(r.schemaVersion!==3||!['legacy','saved','pending','needs_detection'].includes(r.state as string))invalid();const c=record(r.configuration,['providerId','sourcePresetId','baseUrl','anthropicUrl']),configuration={providerId:nullable(c.providerId,provider),sourcePresetId:nullable(c.sourcePresetId,provider),baseUrl:endpoint(c.baseUrl),anthropicUrl:nullable(c.anthropicUrl,endpoint)},inventory=nullable(r.inventory,parseDiscoveredModelCatalogV2),probeSelection=nullable(r.probeSelection,selection),sourceRevision=nullable(r.sourceRevision,hash),operationId=nullable(r.operationId,uuid),sourceRoute=route(r.route);if(probeSelection!==null&&!inventory?.models.some(m=>m.exactModelId===probeSelection.exactModelId)||['saved','pending'].includes(r.state as string)&&(!operationId||!sourceRevision||!probeSelection||!inventory||!configuration.providerId)||sourceRoute==='domestic_private'&&(configuration.providerId===null||['openai','anthropic'].includes(configuration.providerId))||r.state==='legacy'&&(operationId!==null||sourceRevision!==null||inventory!==null||probeSelection!==null))invalid();return {schemaVersion:3 as const,localRef:id(r.localRef),localRevision:hash(r.localRevision),sourceRevision,name:text(r.name,256),route:sourceRoute,inventory,probeSelection,state:r.state as NativeUserSourceViewV3['state'],operationId,configuration}});if(new Set(rows.map(r=>r.localRef)).size!==rows.length)invalid();return rows}
export function parseNativeBuiltinPublicCatalogV1(v:unknown):NativeBuiltinPublicCatalogV1{const r=record(v,['schemaVersion','catalogRevision','checkedAt','expiresAt','models','transports']);if(r.schemaVersion!==1)invalid();const checkedAt=instant(r.checkedAt),expiresAt=instant(r.expiresAt);if(Date.parse(expiresAt)<=Date.parse(checkedAt))invalid();const transports=array(r.transports,256).map(v=>{const r=record(v,['providerId','protocol','baseUrl','adapterRevision','evidenceSha256']);return {providerId:provider(r.providerId),protocol:protocol(r.protocol),baseUrl:endpoint(r.baseUrl,true),adapterRevision:id(r.adapterRevision),evidenceSha256:hash(r.evidenceSha256)}});if(new Set(transports.map(t=>JSON.stringify([t.providerId,t.protocol,t.baseUrl]))).size!==transports.length)invalid();return {schemaVersion:1,catalogRevision:id(r.catalogRevision),checkedAt,expiresAt,models:models(r.models),transports}}
